meta {
  name: Upload Task Photo
  type: http
  seq: 7
}

post {
  url: {{base_url}}/api/v1/master/orders/{{order_id}}/tasks/{{task_id}}/photo
  body: multipartForm
  auth: bearer
}

auth:bearer {
  token: {{token}}
}

headers {
  Accept: application/json
}

body:multipart-form {
  type: before
  photo: @file(/path/to/photo.jpg)
}

docs {
  # Upload Task Photo

  Upload one photo (before or after) for a task.
  Maximum **2 photos per type** (`before` / `after` counted separately).

  Allowed **only while the order is `in_progress`**.
  Photo is converted to WebP asynchronously; response is immediate (`status: pending`).

  ## Fields

  | Field   | Type   | Required | Description                             |
  |---------|--------|----------|-----------------------------------------|
  | `type`  | string | ✅       | `"before"` or `"after"`                 |
  | `photo` | file   | ✅       | Image, max **10 MB** (`max:10240` KB)   |

  ## Flow: upload 2 before photos

  1. POST `type=before` + first photo → 1 item
  2. POST `type=before` + second photo → 2 items
  3. POST again → **422** (limit)

  ## Response 202 Accepted

  ```json
  {
    "data": {
      "id": 7,
      "title": "Замена труб",
      "description": null,
      "before_photos": [
        { "id": 1, "url": "https://example.com/storage/...", "status": "pending" }
      ],
      "after_photos": []
    }
  }
  ```

  ## Errors

  - `401` — missing / invalid master token
  - `404` — order/task not found or not owned by this master
  - `422` — order not `in_progress`, limit reached, or validation (size/type)
}
